          "n_title": "Meet CSIR scientist Akanksha Singh who completed a <i>rare hat-trick</i> of science honours",
          "n_slug": "News",
          "n_description": "CSIR-CIMAP scientist Dr Akanksha Singh has been selected for the NASI Young Scientist Award 2026, completing a rare hat-trick of national recognitions in a single year. Here's what her research in crop protection and agricultural science focuses on, and why it matters for India's farmers.",
